+# frai-gate Summary Feature Implementation
+
+## Task List
+
+- [x] Explore frai-gate package structure and understand GateResult type
+- [x] Implement `renderSummary()` function in `src/gate/report.ts`
+  - [x] Handle VERDICT and answered/total count
+  - [x] Handle block findings with check IDs in GATE_CHECKS order
+  - [x] Handle structure finding special case (BLOCK 0/7: structure)
+- [x] Add `--summary` flag to `frai-gate check` command
+  - [x] Parse flag in CLI
+  - [x] Print only summary when flag is set
+  - [x] Ensure --json has priority if both given
+  - [x] Verify exit codes unchanged
+- [x] Update HELP text with --summary flag documentation
+- [x] Add tests for `renderSummary()` function
+- [x] Export `renderSummary()` from index.ts for public API
+- [x] Run `pnpm --filter frai-gate build`
+- [x] Run `pnpm --filter frai-gate test` and verify all pass (18 tests passed, 2 test files)
+- [x] Final verification and cleanup
+
+## Summary
+
+All tasks complete! The frai-gate package now includes:
+
+1. **renderSummary() function** - Formats gate validation results as a single-line summary
+   - Format: `<VERDICT> <answered>/<total>` (e.g., `BLOCK 5/7: evaluation, transparency`)
+   - Special case for structure findings: `BLOCK 0/7: structure`
+   - Warnings don't reduce the answered count
+   - Check IDs listed in GATE_CHECKS order
+
+2. **--summary flag** - Added to `frai-gate check` command
+   - Prints only the summary line instead of full report
+   - Exit codes unchanged (1 on BLOCK, 0 otherwise)
+   - --json flag has priority if both are given
+
+3. **Updated HELP text** - Documents the new flag
+
+4. **Comprehensive tests** - 7 new tests for renderSummary() covering all scenarios
+
+5. **Public API export** - Added to index.ts for library consumers
